@startuml Tuba_Glider_State_Machine
title Tuba Glider Application State Machine

[*] --> POWERUP_WAIT

POWERUP_WAIT --> MENU: EVT_ENTER\n(user presses ENTER)
POWERUP_WAIT --> DEPLOYED: EVT_TIMEOUT\n(60 sec countdown expires)

MENU --> PARAMS_MENU: "1" / parameters
MENU --> HWTEST_MENU: "2" / hardware test
MENU --> SIMULATE: "3" / simulate deployment
MENU --> DEPLOYED: "4" / deploy\n[sensor_available]
MENU --> OTA_MENU: "5" / firmware update

PARAMS_MENU --> PARAM_INPUT: "1-e" / select parameter
PARAMS_MENU --> PARAMS_MENU: "s" / save\n"r" / reset
PARAMS_MENU --> MENU: "x" / back

PARAM_INPUT --> PARAMS_MENU: parse_input() / [success or failure]

HWTEST_MENU --> PR_MENU: "1" / pitch & roll
HWTEST_MENU --> PUMP_INPUT: "2" / pump test
HWTEST_MENU --> HWTEST_MENU: "3" / show positions\n"4" / internal pressure\n"5" / external pressure\n"6" / GPS
HWTEST_MENU --> COMPASS_MENU: "7" / compass
HWTEST_MENU --> MENU: "x" / back

PR_MENU --> PR_INPUT: "1" / roll motor\n"2" / pitch motor
PR_MENU --> PR_MENU: "3" / limit switch test
PR_MENU --> HWTEST_MENU: "x" / back

PR_INPUT --> PR_INPUT: parse_motor_value() / [-10..10 sec]
PR_INPUT --> PR_MENU: "q" / quit

PUMP_INPUT --> PUMP_INPUT: parse_pump_value() / [-10..10 sec]
PUMP_INPUT --> HWTEST_MENU: "q" / quit

COMPASS_MENU --> COMPASS_MENU: "1" / calibrate\n"2" / stream heading
COMPASS_MENU --> HWTEST_MENU: "x" / back

OTA_MENU --> MENU: "x" / cancel
OTA_MENU --> MENU: ota_download_error / [error]
OTA_MENU --> [*]: ota_reboot / [success]

DEPLOYED --> MENU: deploy_complete / [async thread done]
DEPLOYED --> RECOVERY: deploy_error / [exception/error]

SIMULATE --> MENU: simulate_complete / [async thread done]

RECOVERY --> DEPLOYED: "resume" / resume deployment
RECOVERY --> RECOVERY: (other input)

note right of POWERUP_WAIT
    Countdown timer (60 sec)
    waiting for user intervention.
    Prevents accidental deployment.
    
    on_entry: starts timeout timer
    on_exit: stops timer
end note

note right of MENU
    Main control center.
    User selects mission mode:
    - Configure parameters
    - Test hardware
    - Deploy or simulate
    - Update firmware
end note

note right of PARAMS_MENU
    Edit deployment parameters:
    - Dive depth, timing
    - Motor positions
    - Pump timing
    - Compass heading
    
    Parameters stored in
    non-volatile memory
end note

note right of HWTEST_MENU
    Hardware diagnostics:
    - Motor control (pitch, roll)
    - Pump control
    - Pressure sensors
    - GPS fix
    - Compass calibration
    - Limit switches
end note

note right of DEPLOYED
    Active deployment state.
    Runs asynchronous mission:
    1. Wait deploy_wait_s
    2. Dive to depth
    3. Execute maneuver profile
    4. Return to surface
    
    on_entry: spawns worker thread
    Uses external pressure sensor
end note

note right of SIMULATE
    Lab testing mode.
    Runs same sequence as DEPLOYED
    but with simulated pressure.
    Useful for testing without
    accessing real pressure sensor.
end note

note right of RECOVERY
    Error recovery state.
    Waits for "resume" command
    to retry deployment with
    same parameters.
end note

note right of OTA_MENU
    Over-The-Air firmware update.
    User provides URL to binary.
    On success: verifies and
    reboots to apply update.
    On failure: returns to MENU.
end note

@enduml
